 "data": {
  "why": "A gas tank water heater cut open (a see-through tank) in the kitchen gap: a flame heats a tank of water, the heat leaks out, a foam jacket keeps it in, the water overheats, a thermostat shuts the flame off; then the dip tube and the hot outlet, and the anode rod myth. The camera opens close on the flame and tank, stays mid on the heater, and ends on the home view.",
  "story": {
   "title": "How a water heater works",
   "hero": "a water heater",
   "parts": [
    "tank",
    "water",
    "gas flame",
    "foam jacket",
    "thermostat",
    "dip tube",
    "hot water pipe",
    "anode rod",
    "relief valve",
    "flue",
    "drain valve"
   ],
   "ideas": [
    {
     "role": "hook",
     "idea": "a tank of water over a flame is already a water heater"
    },
    {
     "role": "problem",
     "idea": "heat escapes through the thin tank walls and the water cools"
    },
    {
     "role": "fix1",
     "idea": "a thick foam jacket keeps the heat in"
    },
    {
     "role": "problem2",
     "idea": "now the water keeps heating until it nearly boils"
    },
    {
     "role": "fix2",
     "idea": "a thermostat shuts the flame off at 120 degrees Fahrenheit"
    },
    {
     "role": "name",
     "idea": "this tank with a burner and a thermostat is a water heater"
    },
    {
     "role": "how",
     "idea": "cold water flows in at the bottom through a dip tube and hot water leaves from the top"
    },
    {
     "role": "myth",
     "idea": "the metal rod inside is not a heating element"
    },
    {
     "role": "mythFact",
     "idea": "it is an anode rod that rusts away so the tank does not"
    },
    {
     "role": "finish",
     "idea": "a relief valve, a flue and a drain valve complete the heater"
    },
    {
     "role": "congrats",
     "idea": "calm end: the finished heater stands in the kitchen"
    }
   ],
   "chain": [
    {
     "problem": "problem",
     "causedBy": "hook",
     "shows": "orange heat arrows stream out of the tank sides",
     "stakes": "gas is wasted and the shower runs cold",
     "size": 3
    },
    {
     "problem": "problem2",
